<title>USA: Univ. of Louisville, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Univ. of Louisville, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $15.250 million of University of Louisville, Ky., consolidated educational buildings refunding revenue bonds, Series L, with a net interest cost of 4.90 percent.</p>
</text>
